OL,3,GNEWSAKu Klux Klan hood placed on statue
OL,4,Ain speech protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FProtesters against an upcoming speaking
OL,7,Fevent with an academic who accused the
OL,8,Flate Cambridge professor Jason Arday of
OL,9,Fplagiarism have placed a Ku Klux Klan
OL,10,Fhood on a controversial statue of the
OL,11,F19th Century colonialist Cecil Rhodes.
OL,13,FNathan Cofnas, a self-defined "race
OL,14,Frealist" who argues genes play a
OL,15,F"non-trivial role" in intelligence
OL,16,Fdifferences between racial groups, is
OL,17,Fdue to speak at an event at Oriel
OL,18,FCollege in Oxford later this month.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
