OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F338A1794518738
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAKu Klux Klan hood placed on statue
OL,4,Ain speech protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FObjecting to the event, the campaign
OL,7,Fgroup Led By Donkeys placed a white Ku
OL,8,FKlux Klan hood and a sign reading
OL,9,F"Racists Welcome Here" on the Rhodes
OL,10,Fstatue at Oriel College on Thursday
OL,11,Fmorning.
OL,13,FIn response to the protest, the college
OL,14,Fsaid it was "committed to upholding
OL,15,Ffreedom of speech within the law and
OL,16,Fhas a statutory duty to do so".
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
